cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SPARTA: graph-transport analysis of dual spatial barriers to immunotherapy in cutaneous tumours"
abstract: >-
  SPARTA poses T-cell migration and antibody mass transport as two transport
  problems on the same spatial-transcriptomics graph, changing only the
  edge-weight semantics and the operator: a source-sink minimum cut for the
  cellular barrier and a screened Poisson diffusion-absorption field for the
  macromolecular barrier. CPU-only; the core operators depend on NumPy, SciPy
  and NetworkX alone.
type: software
license: MIT
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-27"
authors:
